      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=r^2,\\\\↵x+y=6.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "155",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "155. $c$是什么数时，下列方程组有解？",
        "$\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\↵x+y=c.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "156",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "156. 解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{1}{6},\\\\↵2x-y=5;\\end{cases}$ б) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{1}{20},\\\\x+2y=14;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}x+y=14,\\\\↵\\frac{x}{y}+\\frac{y}{x}=2\\frac{1}{12};\\end{cases}$ г) $\\begin{cases}x-y=2,\\\\\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac{5}{6}.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "157",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "157. 解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}(x+y)(x-y)=0,\\\\↵2x-y=1;\\end{cases}$ б) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=25,\\\\(x-3)(y-5)=0;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\↵(x-7y)(x+7y)=0;\\end{cases}$ г) $\\begin{cases}x^2-y^2=50,\\\\x(y+1)=0.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "158",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "158. 求下列方程组的解集合：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=40,\\\\↵xy=-12;\\end{cases}$ б) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=80,\\\\xy=24;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=15,\\\\↵xy=6;\\end{cases}$ г) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2+xy=9,\\\\xy=-24.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "159",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "159. 下列方程组有解吗？",
        "$\\begin{cases}x^2-3xy+y^2+x+2y=8,\\\\↵2x-5y=-1,\\\\↵3y-x=2.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
